WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.634 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.136 line:92%
During a cabinet meeting today,

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:06.573
President Trump repeated
his claim that no president

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:09.642
has ever been as tough on Russia
as he has.

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:12.078 line:92%
And it's true. He was tough.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:15.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
He even took away
their soccer ball.

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:18.818 size:78% position:39%
"You'll get this back
when you can behave."

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:20.286 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:21.187 line:92%
According to "Vanity Fair,"

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:24.257
White House Chief of Staff
John Kelly was irate with

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:25.125 line:92%
President Trump's comments

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.861 size:84% position:42%
at his press conference
with Vladimir Putin.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:28.495 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay, that's fair.

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:32.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
But also when isn't
this guy irate?

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:32.799 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:36.970
Every photo of John Kelly looks
like he just found out this play

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.039 size:84% position:42% line:92%
has another 45 minutes.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.440 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.843
President Trump attacked his
critics this morning tweeting,

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:47.380
"Some people hate the fact
that I got along well with

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.481 line:92%
President Putin of Russia.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
They would rather go to war
than see this.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's called
Trump Derangement Syndrome."

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:54.554 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Hey, man, just a tip --

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:59.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
maybe don't name a derangement
syndrome after yourself.

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:05.198
The guy who discovered syphilis
didn't name it Steve's disease.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:09.436 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:12.939 size:75% position:38% line:92%
"Oh, I got Steve's."

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:17.077
According to a new poll, 73% of
Democrats want a fresh face

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.345
to be their presidential nominee
in 2020.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:23.516
And as soon as he heard this,
Bernie went for the Botox.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:27.620 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:28.788 line:92%
That's right, 73% of Democrats

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:32.492
want a fresh face to be their
presidential nominee in 2020.

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:36.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
Coincidentally, fresh face is
what Stephen Miller

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:38.131 line:92%
had for dinner last night.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:43.269 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:45.171 line:92%
"Are you sure it's fresh?"

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.708 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.444 line:92%
"I like to eat the smile first."

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:54.314 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:56.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump
suggested last night

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
that he may not protect
Montenegro

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:00.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
under NATO's mutual defense
pact.

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:03.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
In fact, he doesn't even like
to say Montenegro

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:07.193
because he thinks
that's why Papa John got fired.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:14.134 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:17.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
During President Trump's visit
to the U.K.,

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:20.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
Queen Elizabeth
reportedly wore a brooch

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:23.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
given to her
by former President Obama.

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:23.676 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Wow!

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
Usually --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:29.082 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I got to say.

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:33.686
Usually it's only her hats
that throw that much shade.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:35.555 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:38.224
The House released a spending
bill today that sets aside

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:42.028
$5 billion to build President
Trump's proposed border wall.

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:44.764
Ugh, can we just tell him
we built it and move on?

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:47.066
It's not like he's gonna go down
and check.

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:49.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
He knows there are
Hispanic people there.

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:51.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, let's just do
a Google search

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:54.274
for "Great Wall of China,"
throw some gold letters on it

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:56.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
and tell him it came in
under budget.

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:58.811
Boom, there you go. We never
have to talk about it again.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:03.416 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:05.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
according to a new study,

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:08.988
men who drink four to seven
servings of alcohol per week

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:11.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
are more fertile
than men who do not drink.

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:15.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're calling this study
Irish people.

